{"ID":"20240513083105-vn2jrvf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083105-vn2jrvf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083105-vn2jrvf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163216-vzln18b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163216-vzln18b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1075,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163216-vzln18b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1028,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1028\u0026#125;","title":"235","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115935"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513163216-vzln18b","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 929px;","id":"20240513163216-vzln18b","updated":"20240515115935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/20"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"189 H, C"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37歲  瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/20"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：子宮肌瘤，想懷孕。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠：睡很淺，睡時身冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飲食：胃口好，味覺很好，不口渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二便：大便很好，大便一日數行，喝很多水，小便色淡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"月經：以前月經不正常，現在正常，但懷疑沒有流乾淨，近來量不多，沒有血塊，時七日時八九日有未盡感，行房後有輕微出血，現在經期中，平常不會不正常的出血。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸腹：三陰交及耳部子宮卵巢區皆無壓痛點，腹部生一硬塊。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足：雙足皆平溫，有時足踝會水腫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其它：不易懷孕，在附近的中醫說是腎陰虛，腹部長了個瘤，他叫我去看西醫，西醫可能叫我去開刀，他認為是子宮肌瘤，一九九八年拿過小孩之後就不易懷孕，我自己脾氣不好，對別人要求高，生活習慣正常，而且吃素，精神尚可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診： 右脈稍大於左脈。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：舌淡紅有齒痕。\n2、眼診：腎陽反應比較差一點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 月經來時吃：炒麥芽五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→通利乳汁。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"當歸二錢、川芎三錢、熟地二錢、白芍五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四物湯組成，重在補血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茜草三錢、丹皮二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"細辛二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補小腸火。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎陽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"澤瀉四錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→幫助腎利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肆付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"六碗煮二碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"早晚服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 無月經時吃："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"當歸二錢、川芎三錢、生地二錢、白芍三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四物湯，補血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三錢、黃芩三錢、半夏三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→小柴胡湯，疏肝清肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鬱金五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→解鬱氣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茜草三錢、丹皮三錢、桃仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子三錢、補骨脂三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎陽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"澤瀉五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→幫助腎利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. HT8（桂枝茯苓丸）六兩二罐，午飯及睡前吃30粒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"發生的事情不要後悔，妳在後悔的時候，我治病的力量還要加倍，所以要開心，保持平常心。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右脈大於左脈，一般來說，月經來氣大於血，而懷孕時是血大於氣，也就是左脈大於右脈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三陰交沒有壓痛，這應屬於良性的肌瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹腔屬於肝經的位置，我用活血化瘀藥，我分二種藥，一種是沒有月經的時候吃，一種是月經的時候吃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝茯苓丸對子宮肌瘤的消除非常的好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其它癌症的話一定會裡寒很盛，這一定是陰實。如果是陰實導致陽不入陰，這時上面會熱下面會寒，寒熱分隔會很明顯，晚上會躁熱，月經會影響很大，還會有不正常的出血。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妳還是有機會懷孕的，妳肌瘤拿掉還是會再長回來，而且妳那麼大一個，很難保證肌瘤拿掉還能保留子宮，這種情況下我們不認為妳不能懷孕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生小孩不是病，給西醫體檢沒有關係。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"西醫檢查眼睛是看形，中醫檢查眼睛是看神。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}